error[E5007]: a closure that captures the reference 't' cannot escape
  --> main.prism:7:38
    7 | fun g(t: &mut Todo): Button = Button({ t.id })
      |                                      ^^^^^^^^ stored in a field here
  --> main.prism:7:40
    7 | fun g(t: &mut Todo): Button = Button({ t.id })
      |                                        ^^^^ 't' is captured here
   = note: a closure that escapes owns what it captures, and a reference cannot be owned
